{
    "title": "Help Me: Tricky Story",
    "description": "Help Me: Tricky Story is a new breath to all brain games, a kind of brain test with original scenarios as happen in daily life. It will blow your brain out, thus you will be the riddle master.\r\n\r\nThis fun game is the best combination of brain puzzles. You will also have fun as you did in the braindom games. You can enjoy this mind games, decision making game with the fun brain teasers.\r\n\r\nTry this impossible mind blowing brain game, solve the tricky puzzles, find the solution, and crush each level in this brain test mind games.\r\n\r\nHelp Me: Tricky Story has hundreds of logic puzzles that you prove yourself by solving smart tests and mind blowing riddles. Can you find the impossible solution and help the characters.\r\n\r\nYou will like simple graphics but alive with easy and fun gameplay:\r\n\r\n- Apply real-life logic to beat the challenges.\r\n- Different brain teasers\r\n- Increase your free thinking\r\n- Think outside the box\r\n- Use hints if you need a clue.\r\n- Try a different strategy, think bigger\r\n- Find solutions to the riddles.\r\n- Simple and highly addictive gameplay\r\n\r\nHelp Me: Tricky Story will bring you an excellent brainwash experience within the scope of brain teaser games. Ready for trainning your brain and dexterity!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Help Me: Tricky Story is a new breath to all brain games, a kind of brain test with original scenarios as happen in daily life. It will blow your brain out, thus you will be the riddle master.<br><br>This fun game is the best combination of brain puzzles. You will also have fun as you did in the braindom games. You can enjoy this mind games, decision making game with the fun brain teasers.<br><br>Try this impossible mind blowing brain game, solve the tricky puzzles, find the solution, and crush each level in this brain test mind games.<br><br>Help Me: Tricky Story has hundreds of logic puzzles that you prove yourself by solving smart tests and mind blowing riddles. Can you find the impossible solution and help the characters.<br><br>You will like simple graphics but alive with easy and fun gameplay:<br><br>- Apply real-life logic to beat the challenges.<br>- Different brain teasers<br>- Increase your free thinking<br>- Think outside the box<br>- Use hints if you need a clue.<br>- Try a different strategy, think bigger<br>- Find solutions to the riddles.<br>- Simple and highly addictive gameplay<br><br>Help Me: Tricky Story will bring you an excellent brainwash experience within the scope of brain teaser games. Ready for trainning your brain and dexterity!",
